  "details": "The newest version of toon standard comes with a very useful feature allowing a specific channel of the image to be selected for each map. This is extremely useful and time-saving, as it prevents the need to rely on the alpha channel when designing maps. \n\nHowever, this does highlight the fact that this functionality is absent in standard lite. My request is to add similar functionality that allows the user to choose which channels are used with mask and metallic/smoothness textures.",
